\"id\":150530,\"name\":\"Sneha Ullal\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dS6AD6WaSsbI79g0LCkUPfwUGCV.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":645370,\"title\":\"Bypass Road\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rpcgHflODKQu4s5mtWim4sAi95B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2kHSjYmajkM5zDgnYhXU4R4PjYK.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A top fashion designer has a serious accident the very night his ex-lover mysteriously dies, raising questions on whether the incidents are related.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268534,\"title\":\"Kya Dilli Kya Lahore\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4q9fNNQj9lKhTfbeaXegXybYbxx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJ8xrTmjRhCoPKJ5Z3qODsel6qh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1948, a cross-fire erupts at an isolated stretch of Indo-Pak border, leaving only two soldiers alive. One is an Indian soldier of Pakistani origin while the other happens to be a Pakistani soldier of Indian origin. An ironic story of pride and survival begins when - in an attempt to evade danger, they bump into each other. And amidst continuous exchange of bullets, altercations and murkier situations, it evolves into a journey of human connection with an unforeseeable end.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456570,\"title\":\"Hindi Medium\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/laYowJmKFM0HjKGuTwUSSPo4Xci.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aSjOJMrQYz3EC5e7JzfGxy2Yhuh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mita and Raj Batra, an affluent couple from Delhi’s Chandni Chowk, are grappling with getting their daughter admission into an English medium school. But there is one big problem. Their zubaan is Hindi, and the elitist snobs won’t let the Hindi speaking hoi-polloi fit in.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268860,\"title\":\"Hawaa Hawaai\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pqLf2SlhM02EEzY9ZjYMXxumJdB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3sOiKPZAP5YSCzD280CkmPiF3nE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hawaa Hawaai is a story of the triumph of the human spirit; friendship and enjoying the journey of making ones dream come true. Arjun moves to the big city along with his mother and little sister. Out there he discovers a hidden world of in-line skating through coach Lucky, who mentors kids to become skating champions. While Arjun starts nursing the dream to learn skating under Lucky, his four friends get together to make this dream come true for him. In this endearing story of hope and aspirations, will Arjun's dreams take flight?\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645489,\"title\":\"Gunjan Saxena: The Kargil Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/csk2n4VY4bl01KqGtbnV0IG3hJs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezaMkH1y6fFvJydpsc3Hf3oXcIu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Inspired by the life of a fearless young officer who made history by becoming the first Indian female Air Force officer to fly in a combat zone during the 1999 Kargil War\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1043143,\"title\":\"Mask\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vfROEDdZ7dT3GrgXo34mEEalL45.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Praveen Tewari, a Bank watchman, resides in Kolkata with his wife Shikha and daughter Tukai. His salary is usually stalled for months like a number of government employers. When the Corona pandemic emerges, everybody is buying and wearing masks, except Praveen. He simply denies wearing one, and regularly finds various propagandas from a YouTube channel. He has been so extensively tortured by the people nearby that he even dreams of people forcing him to wear a mask. The story takes a twisted turn when he gets into an argument with a customer which ultimately leaves him jobless. Broken and dejected by the family and society, Praveen turns alcoholic along with a bus conductor who eventually denies providing him more alcohol unless he wears a mask. Haunted with the desire to consume more alcohol, he puts on his mask.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":643807,\"title\":\"Ramprasad Ki Tehrvi\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/isiZRJmqQ0Wu7ELJrBdqD8P2HI6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kPGDJMDlOaIyFWTjcxVScWQolMl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ramprasad's entire family gathers under one roof for 13 days after his death, to perform and observe the Hindu traditions and rituals called the tehrvi. During the course, the family’s dynamics, politics, and insecurities come out, and then they realise that the importance of people and things are only evident in retrospect.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645484,\"title\":\"Dil Bechara\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lMFjMrc8Bn0CQhtJDORfspXrWrK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tnwoGCRe2GV05f1RSIl1PusYc9v.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kizie and Manny, two ordinary people brought together by a tragic twist, embark on a bittersweet and extraordinary journey into the heart of that crazy little thing called 'life'.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456756,\"title\":\"Bank Chor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tKrtqEs1gffyZNlHW9WduRRjKGA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s4yij4yVaim0kgt9UuuYCHIIoOH.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A comic-caper, that tells the story of 3 morons trying to rob a bank who pick the worst day possible when everything that can go wrong, goes wrong and how they're inadvertently caught in the crossfire.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":458032,\"title\":\"Dobaara: See Your Evil\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kTN2AlNjerZb2HAGv4xm4FadKfm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l6IobeO3kNPz7HwL9sYPbx4TT53.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An official adaptation of the cult horror film Oculus. The film revolves around a haunted mirror. It shows the emotional journey of siblings Natasha Merchant played by Huma Qureshi and Kabeer Merchant played by Saqib Saleem dealing with the death of their parents.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"HKAxgdQ91mc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"7cViYp1dyXw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"xDLBVMm-u4o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}